        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIMINAL WATERS is a liminal space walking simulator,  enchanted by the radiant beauty of Unreal Engine 5.6. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique and never bevore seen environments. No Monsters. Eerie atmosphere and feelings of unease, confusion, and confinement may arise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle events and sophisticated sound design immerse the player in the game world – there is no interface or mission objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on exploring the detailed and beautifully lit levels and finding the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Waters requires modern hardware to run properly. Please read the System requirements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laptop devices may not be supported!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is not designed to run on Steam Deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has controller support, so sit back and enjoy your trip into the strange and mysterious pool rooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You get:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric Exploration Experience of Epic Proportions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 3 Hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted Environments and Soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Graphics featuring the latest Unreal Engine 5 tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No maze like levels. Straight forward level design that doesn't waste your time by looping the player around.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENHANCED EDITION:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Enhanced Edition features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Level has been enhanced and reworked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More custom Events added to the Game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massively Improved Lighting compared to the Original Game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Stuff to explore. More Rooms and Secrets to discover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Sounds and Music added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better Graphics Menu + Mouse Invert Option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skippable Intro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Update for Owners of the Original Game!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIMINAL WATERS is a liminal space walking simulator,  enchanted by the radiant beauty of Unreal Engine 5.6. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique and never bevore seen environments. No Monsters. Eerie atmosphere and feelings of unease, confusion, and confinement may arise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle events and sophisticated sound design immerse the player in the game world – there is no interface or mission objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on exploring the detailed and beautifully lit levels and finding the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Waters requires modern hardware to run properly. Please read the System requirements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laptop devices may not be supported!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is not designed to run on Steam Deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has controller support, so sit back and enjoy your trip into the strange and mysterious pool rooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You get:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric Exploration Experience of Epic Proportions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 3 Hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted Environments and Soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Graphics featuring the latest Unreal Engine 5 tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No maze like levels. Straight forward level design that doesn't waste your time by looping the player around.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENHANCED EDITION:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Enhanced Edition features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Level has been enhanced and reworked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More custom Events added to the Game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massively Improved Lighting compared to the Original Game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Stuff to explore. More Rooms and Secrets to discover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Sounds and Music added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better Graphics Menu + Mouse Invert Option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skippable Intro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Update for Owners of the Original Game!</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Explore, Listen and Observe. LIMINAL WATERS is a liminal space exploration game. Discover a large facility with diverse rooms and themes and be enchanted by the radiant beauty of Unreal Engine 5.6. Relaxation, anxiety, confusion or familiarity? The mysterious Poolrooms are waiting for you.",
